name: Police
tagline: "A seeded criminal-investigation Link Analysis demo - a burglary series traced through dealer sales and one vehicle, a drug-supply handset network with a rotating controller number, drug bases at vulnerable residents' addresses and a witness who was arrested with the suspect, each beside a benign look-alike"
description: "The police intelligence Link Analysis demo as a Space Template (Basic tier; plan docs/archived-documents/plans-archive/2026-11-07-la-showcase-police-insurance-utility-plan.md). Eleven synthetic feeds (incident_report, person, incident_person, vehicle, plate_read, call_record, handset, custody, dealer_sale, property_stolen, address; 12 months in data/inbox, the next month in data/staged) are landed by eleven Collectors and Pipelines: about 4 000 incidents, 6 000 people, 40 000 plate reads and 30 000 calls. The police_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, event_date, via) of nine link kinds; three Jobs derive the stolen-property circle, the busy handsets and the repeat witnesses from it, one per saved view. Planted stories (ground truth pinned by LaPoliceLinksJobTest and tools/gen-la-police-data.test.mjs): 18 burglaries in Leeds North and Leeds East in Feb-Apr 2026, 40 percent of the items resurfacing at two dealers through three sellers with the serial matching on 60 percent of those, and a vehicle kept by one seller's partner seen within 2 km and 30 minutes of 11 scenes; five controller numbers in turn, every 3-5 weeks, four runner numbers and 60 customer numbers, at least 70 percent of customers carrying over; three lone, vulnerable residents rung often by the runners; one witness to two unrelated incidents who was co-arrested with the suspect of one. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: a taxi seen near 54 other scenes, a delivery driver's number with 208 short-call contacts, a busy shared house of 11, a shopkeeper who witnessed 6 incidents. The Basic tier runs on every edition. The Advanced tier ships in the same template and stays inert on Basic: Demo Users and roles (demo-users.toon, roles.toon: police.analyst lead, police.sio second approver, police.reviewer read-only, police.outsider not a member, admin), four-eyes above a fan-out of 2000 and Drafts (link-analysis.toon), and the Alert Rule police_repeat_seller_serial_matches over the police_serial_match_counts Job (it fires on the series sellers, never on a one-off sale of a stolen item; unarmed on Basic). The Investigation, its members, an Entity List of the sellers, a pending four-eyes expand, a Draft and a Case are runtime state: run node tools/seed-la-police.mjs --apply on a Demo Auth build. The saved Geo View needs the Geo map (Standard and above). Synthetic data only; regenerate with tools/gen-la-police-data.py."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:finger-print
contents[8]: "11 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (12 months, next month staged)", "police_links Job + Dataset (9 link kinds, event_date, via)", "3 derived link Jobs + Datasets (property circle, handset network, repeat witnesses)", "3 saved views", "1 saved Geo View (Standard and above)", "4 planted stories, 4 benign look-alikes", "Advanced tier: 5 Demo Users + role table, four-eyes, Alert Rule on repeat-seller serial matches (inert on Basic)", "Synthetic data (tools/gen-la-police-data.py)"
